//// set: cx-c12 — 常量变率、体里带外层迭代变量的归约（不带数组）：for 语句 / 数组构造子 / 嵌套归约
//// model: C120
model C120
  constant Real x[5] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
  constant Real m[2, 3] = {{1, 2, 3}, {4, 5, 6}};
  constant Integer k[3] = {3, 1, 2};
  parameter Integer p = 2;
  Integer n = integer(time) + 1;
  Real tt = time;
  Real y[2]; algorithm for i in 1:2 loop y[i] := sum(i * j for j in 1:3); end for;
end C120;
//// model: C121
model C121
  constant Real x[5] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
  constant Real m[2, 3] = {{1, 2, 3}, {4, 5, 6}};
  constant Integer k[3] = {3, 1, 2};
  parameter Integer p = 2;
  Integer n = integer(time) + 1;
  Real tt = time;
  Real y[2]; algorithm for i in 1:2 loop y[i] := sum(i for j in 1:3); end for;
end C121;
//// model: C122
model C122
  constant Real x[5] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
  constant Real m[2, 3] = {{1, 2, 3}, {4, 5, 6}};
  constant Integer k[3] = {3, 1, 2};
  parameter Integer p = 2;
  Integer n = integer(time) + 1;
  Real tt = time;
  Real y[2]; algorithm for i in 1:2 loop y[i] := product(i + j for j in 1:3); end for;
end C122;
//// model: C123
model C123
  constant Real x[5] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
  constant Real m[2, 3] = {{1, 2, 3}, {4, 5, 6}};
  constant Integer k[3] = {3, 1, 2};
  parameter Integer p = 2;
  Integer n = integer(time) + 1;
  Real tt = time;
  Real y[2]; algorithm for i in 1:2 loop y[i] := max(i * j for j in 1:3); end for;
end C123;
//// model: C124
model C124
  constant Real x[5] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
  constant Real m[2, 3] = {{1, 2, 3}, {4, 5, 6}};
  constant Integer k[3] = {3, 1, 2};
  parameter Integer p = 2;
  Integer n = integer(time) + 1;
  Real tt = time;
  Real y[2]; algorithm for i in 1:2 loop y[i] := min(i * j for j in 1:3); end for;
end C124;
//// model: C125
model C125
  constant Real x[5] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
  constant Real m[2, 3] = {{1, 2, 3}, {4, 5, 6}};
  constant Integer k[3] = {3, 1, 2};
  parameter Integer p = 2;
  Integer n = integer(time) + 1;
  Real tt = time;
  Real y[2]; algorithm for i in 1:2 loop y[i] := sum(p * i * j for j in 1:3); end for;
end C125;
//// model: C126
model C126
  constant Real x[5] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
  constant Real m[2, 3] = {{1, 2, 3}, {4, 5, 6}};
  constant Integer k[3] = {3, 1, 2};
  parameter Integer p = 2;
  Integer n = integer(time) + 1;
  Real tt = time;
  Real y[2]; algorithm for i in 1:2 loop y[i] := sum(i * j * tt for j in 1:3); end for;
end C126;
//// model: C127
model C127
  constant Real x[5] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
  constant Real m[2, 3] = {{1, 2, 3}, {4, 5, 6}};
  constant Integer k[3] = {3, 1, 2};
  parameter Integer p = 2;
  Integer n = integer(time) + 1;
  Real tt = time;
  Real y[2]; algorithm for i in 1:2 loop y[i] := sum(j for j in 1:3); end for;
